('APX-C-477', '477', 'Girl in Traditional Chinese Attire Begins Her Emotional', 'A girl in traditional Chinese attire begins her emotional and passionate dance on the still, dark water. The camera moves in to capture her face full of emotion, then pulls back sharply to reveal the sweeping gestures of her long sleeves.', null, null, 'https://x.com/churvikv/status/2024158161964274138', 'A girl in traditional Chinese attire begins her emotional and passionate dance on the still, dark water. The camera moves in to capture her face full of emotion, then pulls back sharply to reveal the sweeping gestures of her long sleeves. The shots are filmed from various angles - from below to accentuate the power and grace of her movements, and from above, turning her dance into a mesmerizing pattern on the water. Each of her steps and turns is filled with passion. Golden sparks and cherry blossom petals swirl around her, and the water beneath her feet erupts in golden circles in time with her expressive movements.', null, null, 'missing', 3, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'stylized-real', null, '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: music', 'seedance_2.0', '@churvikv', 'https://x.com/churvikv', null, null),
