('APX-S-431-1', 'APX-C-431', 1, null, null, null, '**### Visual Style** 9: 16 Vertical composition, 4K ultra-clear realistic image quality. Low-key lighting style with high contrast. The cool-toned environment background and the subject''s all-black outfit create a stark contrast, emphasizing the character''s silhouette and skin sheen, with the typical sharp texture of social media short videos. **### Scene Description** Indoor home environment (suspected modern-style kitchen or living room), with a blurred white cabinet visible in the background.', null, null, 'The cool-toned environment background and the subject''s all-black outfit create a stark contrast, emphasizing the character''s silhouette and skin sheen, with the typical sharp texture of social media short videos.', null, null, null, null, 'kitchen', null),
