('APX-S-363-1', 'APX-C-363', 1, null, null, null, 'Opening - Silent Dawn (Using Combined Camera Movement 3: Ascending Reveal) The scene begins with a close-up of a spider web covered in morning dew, the dewdrops reflecting a blurred pastoral reflection. The camera slowly pulls back and rises like a breath, gradually revealing the boundless rice fields below, tightly locked in thin fog. On the distant horizon, a thin silver line silently cuts through the grayish-blue sky—that is the Shinkansen. (Ascending shot + Pull-out shot, Emotion: Tranquility, poetry, foreshadowing) Acceleration - Metal Behemoth (Using Combined Camera Movement 4: Vertigo Chase + partial elements of Combined Movement 1) Suddenly, the camera seems to be captured by magnetic force, sprinting towards the silver track ahead with impossible acceleration.', null, null, 'The camera slowly pulls back and rises like a breath, gradually revealing the boundless rice fields below, tightly locked in thin fog.', null, 'sprinting', 'rice', 'featured', null, null),
('APX-S-363-2', 'APX-C-363', 2, null, null, null, 'Intense handheld shaking simulates the violent air current, and the rice fields instantly turn into a green torrent. The camera rapidly pans horizontally, keeping pace with the rapidly approaching train head. At the moment speed synchronizes, all sound in the world is stripped away, leaving only a visually intense Dutch angle tilt, emphasizing this extraordinary kinetic energy. (Intense handheld shake + Rapid horizontal pan + Dutch angle, Emotion: Burst, shock, imbalance) Penetration - Boundary Shift (Using Combined Camera Movement 9: Spatial Transition) Just before impact with the train head, the camera focuses on the side window of the driver''s cab.', null, null, 'The camera rapidly pans horizontally, keeping pace with the rapidly approaching train head. (Intense shake + Rapid horizontal pan + Dutch angle, Emotion: Burst, shock, imbalance) Penetration - Boundary Shift (Using Combined Camera Movement…', 'driver', null, 'rice', 'featured', 'train', 'intense'),
('APX-S-363-3', 'APX-C-363', 3, null, null, null, 'A cold, honeycomb-like glass texture fills the screen. Match cut point: A slow-motion phantom of a bird hitting the glass, and at the moment of contact, the camera seamlessly penetrates. The cold, high-speed world outside suddenly switches to the warm, silent, low-noise passenger cabin inside. The light transitions from cold blue to warm yellow. (Match cut + Light/texture transformation, Emotion: Magical, turning point, entering an alternate space) Contemplation - The Still Heart (Using Combined Camera Movement 5: Elegant Orbit and elements of Combined Movement 2) After the camera enters, all movement returns to absolute stillness. With a Steadicam-like floating sensation, it gently orbits the woman by the window along the aisle.', null, null, 'Match cut point: A phantom of a bird hitting the glass, and at the moment of contact, the camera seamlessly penetrates. (Match cut + Light/texture transformation, Emotion: Magical, turning point, entering an alternate space) Contemplation…', null, null, null, null, 'cabin', null),
('APX-S-363-4', 'APX-C-363', 4, null, null, null, 'As it passes her profile, an extremely slow push-in focuses on her glasses lens—the blurred, flowing mountains and villages outside the window are reflected in the lens like an abstract painting. Steam from the cup rises slowly, defying physics. (Steadicam smooth orbit + Extremely slow push-in + Macro close-up, Emotion: Serenity, introspection, time suspended) Extraction - External Spiral (Reusing Combined Camera Movement 4: Enhanced Vertigo Chase) The camera exits through the window on the other side, instantly returning to the eye of the speed storm. It begins a high-speed spiral orbit centered on the train, the streamlined body carving dazzling metallic arcs in the sunlight.', null, null, 'As it passes her profile, an extremely slow focuses on her glasses lens—the blurred, flowing mountains and villages outside the window are reflected in the lens like an abstract painting.', null, null, null, null, 'train', null),
('APX-S-363-5', 'APX-C-363', 5, null, null, null, 'The intense orbiting motion combined with handheld tremor is dizzying, showcasing the pure aesthetic of machinery and speed. (High-speed spiral orbit + Handheld shake, Emotion: Abstraction, vertigo, mechanical aesthetic) Curtain Call - Bridge to Heaven and Earth (Using Combined Camera Movement 8: Grand Entrance Variation) At the highest point of the spiral, the camera sharply pulls back and up. The train is crossing a giant iron bridge spanning a lush green canyon, its form appearing precise and elegant. The camera continues to rise, accompanied by a horizontal pan, revealing the full view of the canyon and distant mountains. It finally freezes in a vast aerial long shot: the silver train, like a fine needle, quietly disappears into the shadow tunnel of the great mountain.', null, null, '(High-speed spiral + shake, Emotion: Abstraction, vertigo, mechanical aesthetic) Curtain Call - Bridge to Heaven and Earth (Using Combined Camera Movement 8: Grand Entrance Variation) At the highest point of the spiral, the camera sharply…', null, null, null, null, 'bridge, train, canyon, mountain', 'intense'),
('APX-S-363-6', 'APX-C-363', 6, null, null, null, null, 3663, 234, 'All sounds cease, only the last wisp of a distant whistle echoes gently among the mountains until it fades away. (Large-scale pull-out shot + Ascending/Descending + Horizontal pan, Emotion: Grandeur, detachment, returning to eternity).', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-262-1', 'APX-C-262', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 260, 'Women brutal fight vs elon musk with beautiful kick boxing style, and kick fatality. Consistent characters and environment. THE RAID brutal fight film style (dynamic camera movement).', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-285-1', 'APX-C-285', 1, 0, 5, 5, null, 447, 353, 'The Master looks ferocious, his finger almost poking the camera, spitting saliva. He violently rips off his tie, staring wide-eyed at you.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-285-2', 'APX-C-285', 2, 5, 10, 5, null, 816, 396, 'The Master paces frantically on stage, waving his arms as if commanding thousands of troops.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-285-3', 'APX-C-285', 3, 10, 15, 5, null, 1228, 427, 'Audience: Stands up frantically, applauds, some even have tears in their eyes.', null, null, null, null, null, 'intense'),
('APX-S-281-1', 'APX-C-281', 1, 0, 3, 3, null, 333, 254, 'Mid-shot, a young man in a bespoke suit sits in a leather boss chair, his face cold and eyes indifferent. Standing before him is a beautiful girl in a white dress, her eyes, tears welling up.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-281-2', 'APX-C-281', 2, 4, 8, 4, null, 597, 363, 'The girl''s voice trembles, "What chance did you give me? You never trusted me from the start!" She turns to leave, the man suddenly stands up and grabs her wrist.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-281-3', 'APX-C-281', 3, 9, 12, 3, null, 971, 264, 'The man stares into the girl''s eyes, his voice low, "Do you still want to leave now?" The girl bites her lip, "Leave... where else can I go?" She fiercely shakes off his hand and runs away.', null, 'sprinting; biting', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-281-4', 'APX-C-281', 4, 13, 15, 2, null, 1247, 560, 'The camera follows the girl rushing out of the office. She wipes away tears in front of the elevator, but the tears keep flowing. The moment the elevator door slowly closes, she squats down and cries into her arms.', null, 'leaping', null, null, 'office', null),
('APX-S-281-5', 'APX-C-281', 5, 0, 3, 3, null, 1817, 340, 'A beautiful girl with a high ponytail slowly walks towards him, the camera slightly shakes with every step the girl takes to create tension.', null, null, null, null, null, 'intense'),
('APX-S-281-6', 'APX-C-281', 6, 4, 8, 4, null, 2167, 351, 'The girl approaches the boy. The boy takes a deep breath, raises his hand several times to hand over the letter but pulls it back.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-281-7', 'APX-C-281', 7, 9, 12, 3, null, 2529, 372, 'The girl glances at the time, "Class is starting soon, let''s talk next time," and turns to leave. The boy gathers his courage, "Wait!" He grabs her wrist, both freeze simultaneously.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-281-8', 'APX-C-281', 8, 13, 15, 2, null, 2913, 546, 'The camera slowly pushes in for a close-up of the girl''s face. A sweet smile slowly spreads across her lips, stars twinkling in her eyes.', null, null, null, null, 'restaurant', 'calm'),
('APX-S-281-9', 'APX-C-281', 9, 0, 3, 3, null, 3469, 314, 'Mid-shot fixed camera, a beautiful girl is celebrating her birthday with friends, laughter is joyful. The restaurant door is suddenly pushed open—her most trusted best friend walks in arm-in-arm with her boyfriend.', 'family', null, 'wine', 'featured', 'restaurant', 'playful'),
('APX-S-281-10', 'APX-C-281', 10, 4, 8, 4, null, 3793, 480, 'The best friend''s expression is momentarily unnatural when she sees the girl, she tries to pull the boyfriend to another seat, but the boyfriend shakes off her hand and walks straight to the girl, placing a gift box in front of her, "Happy…', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-281-11', 'APX-C-281', 11, 9, 12, 3, null, 4284, 348, 'The girl says nothing, just quietly picks up the wine glass and drinks it in one go. Then she stands up and walks to the best friend. Everyone holds their breath.', null, 'pouring', 'wine', 'featured', null, null),
('APX-S-281-12', 'APX-C-281', 12, 13, 15, 2, null, 4644, 384, 'The girl leans close to the best friend''s ear and whispers softly, "Next time you steal someone''s man, remember to hide what shouldn''t be exposed first." The best friend''s face turns pale. The girl turns and walks away elegantly.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-267-1', 'APX-C-267', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 280, 'High-intensity action thriller scene, hand-held shaky camera, the woman storms into the cockpit and freezes as she realizes the pilot seats are empty, warning alarms flashing, turbulence shaking the cabin, she sprints forward and straps…', null, 'sprinting', null, null, 'cabin', null)
) as v(shot_id, clip_id, shot_index, tc_in, tc_out, duration_s, verbatim_literal,
       slice_at, slice_len, description, subject_role, action, food_item,
       food_role, setting, mood)
join clips c on c.clip_id = v.clip_id
-- The clip insert above is DO NOTHING, so for a clip that ALREADY existed
-- its row still holds the original shot_count and the original shots. Without
-- this guard the shot insert would still run for it, and wherever this
-- splitter finds more beats than the original decomposition did, the extra
-- higher-index shots would land on top — leaving one clip carrying two
-- different decompositions at once (28 clips, 44 stray shots, seen for real).
-- For a clip this load actually inserted, shot_count is this run's own count,
-- so every shot passes.
where v.shot_index::int <= c.shot_count
-- Same reasoning as the clips: never touch a shot that already exists.
on conflict (shot_id) do nothing;
